WEBVTT

00:00:12.490 --> 00:00:15.240
And in recognition of your resolve,

00:00:15.240 --> 00:00:18.210
I'll be honest with you.

00:00:18.210 --> 00:00:21.000
Reona?

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:25.960
You know what? If someone
besides Kamui clears the game...

00:00:25.960 --> 00:00:29.880
I'd like to marry them.

00:00:29.880 --> 00:00:32.050
You remember that, right?

00:00:32.050 --> 00:00:36.010
Y-Yes, but weren't you just joking?

00:00:36.010 --> 00:00:38.600
Hiro, the truth is,

00:00:38.600 --> 00:00:42.940
ten years ago, I met Kamui.

00:00:42.940 --> 00:00:48.030
I say I met him,
but it was only in the game.

00:00:48.030 --> 00:00:52.530
I saw him strutting through Ted
clad in black armor.

00:00:52.530 --> 00:00:59.410
As a fellow high schooler at the time,
I couldn't help but admire him.

00:00:59.410 --> 00:01:05.210
So as he was exiting the city,
I ran up to him,

00:01:05.210 --> 00:01:08.130
and asked him to go out with me.

00:01:08.130 --> 00:01:10.380
That's when...

00:01:14.550 --> 00:01:18.930
I'm not into women
with tits like a Holstein cow.

00:01:18.930 --> 00:01:20.390
What?

00:01:20.390 --> 00:01:23.100
Everything has its limits.

00:01:23.100 --> 00:01:25.940
Your tits are past the limit.

00:01:25.940 --> 00:01:27.780
Bye now.

00:01:31.110 --> 00:01:33.490
Can you believe he said that to me?

00:01:33.490 --> 00:01:34.950
"Past the limit," really?

00:01:34.950 --> 00:01:38.200
My boobs aren't a credit card!

00:01:38.200 --> 00:01:42.040
He then went on to clear
the unbeatable Kiwame Quest!

00:01:42.040 --> 00:01:44.540
So I swore revenge!

00:01:44.540 --> 00:01:49.420
I decided to find somebody else
who successfully cleared KQ.

00:01:49.420 --> 00:01:54.050
"I'll marry <i>them</i>!" I swore.

00:01:55.800 --> 00:01:58.430
Huh? Is that the end?

00:01:58.430 --> 00:01:59.720
That's right!

00:01:59.720 --> 00:02:02.230
So, Hiro, beat the game!

00:02:02.230 --> 00:02:03.640
Then marry me,

00:02:03.640 --> 00:02:07.110
and after our honeymoon,
we'll kiss in front of Kamui

00:02:07.110 --> 00:02:10.780
and give him the finger
together as a happy couple!

