00:03:45.700 --> 00:03:49.000
A New Ally

00:03:51.130 --> 00:03:53.630
That was a letdown.

00:03:53.630 --> 00:03:55.800
When you're that secretive,

00:03:55.800 --> 00:03:59.800
isn't their normally a deeper reason?
The kind that fires people up?

00:03:59.800 --> 00:04:01.720
I'm not fired up at all.

00:04:01.720 --> 00:04:04.600
I've actually lost motivation.

00:04:06.730 --> 00:04:09.940
Hiro, you're still awake.

00:04:11.690 --> 00:04:13.400
Tesla.

00:04:15.530 --> 00:04:18.650
I'm sorry about Amos and Granada.

00:04:18.650 --> 00:04:22.200
Don't be. What's past is past.

00:04:22.200 --> 00:04:25.790
I'm surprised to see you here so late.

00:04:25.790 --> 00:04:28.870
There's no telling when
the goblins will attack.

00:04:28.870 --> 00:04:31.880
It's keeping me awake tonight.

00:04:31.880 --> 00:04:34.250
I think they're coming tonight.

00:04:34.250 --> 00:04:35.090
Oh?

00:04:35.090 --> 00:04:38.340
No, I mean, it's just a hunch.

00:04:38.340 --> 00:04:43.640
I can't just tell him
I read it in a walkthrough.

00:04:45.930 --> 00:04:48.810
You're a curious fellow, Hiro.

00:04:51.560 --> 00:04:53.730
Hiro.

00:04:53.730 --> 00:04:57.110
Something tells me you want
to leave the city. Am I right?

00:04:57.110 --> 00:04:58.360
What?!

00:04:58.360 --> 00:05:00.150
No, I, um... uh...

00:05:00.150 --> 00:05:01.240
I get it. I do.

00:05:01.240 --> 00:05:03.620
If I weren't captain of the Guard,

00:05:03.620 --> 00:05:09.250
I'd want to blow this place and
test my skills out in the great big world.

00:05:09.250 --> 00:05:11.080
Tesla...

00:05:11.080 --> 00:05:14.130
Then let's leave the city together!

00:05:15.790 --> 00:05:17.170
Interesting.

00:05:17.170 --> 00:05:20.470
If we manage to overcome this situation,

00:05:20.470 --> 00:05:24.010
it might not be half bad
to go on a journey together.

00:05:24.010 --> 00:05:25.100
So then...

00:05:25.100 --> 00:05:26.560
I'll consider it.

00:05:26.560 --> 00:05:31.100
Yet another reason to find a way
to deal with this goblin crisis.

00:05:33.020 --> 00:05:38.150
Th-That all made it
seem like he might die...

00:05:38.150 --> 00:05:41.200
I can't allow that to happen.

00:05:41.200 --> 00:05:45.820
Looks like I better check the walkthrough.

00:05:55.670 --> 00:05:59.880
Why're you in my room?!

00:05:59.880 --> 00:06:03.970
Don't tell me you're actually
plotting to take me out

00:06:03.970 --> 00:06:07.890
by covering my nose
and mouth while I play!

00:06:07.890 --> 00:06:09.560
Don't be silly!

00:06:09.560 --> 00:06:11.730
You didn't answer no matter
how much I knocked!

00:06:11.730 --> 00:06:14.140
I thought you might've dropped dead!

00:06:14.140 --> 00:06:16.690
Oh, I see.

00:06:16.690 --> 00:06:19.110
So why'd you come to my room?

00:06:19.110 --> 00:06:22.570
Y-You were acting strange...

00:06:22.570 --> 00:06:25.240
I want to see something through.

00:06:25.240 --> 00:06:27.160
Please let me.

00:06:29.790 --> 00:06:35.000
It seemed like you might try to go out
playing a full-dive RPG or something.

00:06:35.000 --> 00:06:37.250
So I just kinda... came to investigate!

00:06:37.250 --> 00:06:39.840
Oh, you were worried about me!

00:06:39.840 --> 00:06:41.300
A-As if!

00:06:41.300 --> 00:06:44.380
If you died playing video games,
it'd shame the whole family!

00:06:44.380 --> 00:06:47.720
Right, right. Thanks, Kaede!

00:06:48.930 --> 00:06:50.510
Hey!

00:06:50.510 --> 00:06:51.890
What's the big idea?

00:06:51.890 --> 00:06:54.270
You know, it's better
if a rotten otaku like you

00:06:54.270 --> 00:06:57.810
takes a full-dive dirt nap sad and alone!

00:06:57.810 --> 00:07:02.190
What's a full-dive dirt nap?! Hey!

00:07:02.190 --> 00:07:05.150
The nerve of her!

00:07:09.280 --> 00:07:14.200
I remember Kamui said
he'd tell me the trick to KQ.

00:07:14.200 --> 00:07:17.710
You really endured the merc event, right?

00:07:17.710 --> 00:07:21.250
If you lie, I'll stick
1,000 needles in your balls.

00:07:21.250 --> 00:07:23.710
Not make me swallow them?! Scary!

00:07:23.710 --> 00:07:27.470
As proof, enter your current title.

00:07:28.010 --> 00:07:31.930
Diabolic Spiteful Best Friend Killer

00:07:33.850 --> 00:07:38.480
So you earned "Diabolic Spiteful
Best Friend Killer"? Good.

00:07:38.480 --> 00:07:41.940
Is it?! That was a legitimate strategy?

00:07:41.940 --> 00:07:44.360
Of course there were other options,

00:07:44.360 --> 00:07:49.410
but better to be a wicked bastard
than a gutless doormat.

00:07:49.410 --> 00:07:53.830
Very well. I'll tell you the trick to KQ.

00:07:53.030 --> 00:07:54.740
The            Trick

00:07:55.330 --> 00:07:57.370
The trick!

00:08:02.590 --> 00:08:04.630
You mean...

00:08:06.970 --> 00:08:09.090
You're still looking?

00:08:09.090 --> 00:08:10.720
How creepy.

00:08:10.720 --> 00:08:13.060
I've told you all
there is to tell already!

00:08:13.060 --> 00:08:18.350
Don't rely on a walkthrough for
every little thing, you damned sheep!

00:08:18.350 --> 00:08:21.980
Why am I being scolded
for using the walkthrough?!

00:08:21.980 --> 00:08:24.270
Die, dumbass!

00:08:25.230 --> 00:08:28.200
And the site closed itself!

00:08:31.450 --> 00:08:34.950
There's nothing left but to do it.

00:08:35.700 --> 00:08:40.830
Day 6: Day of the Goblin Assault

00:08:35.700 --> 00:08:40.830
Day 6: Day of the Goblin Assault

00:08:38.120 --> 00:08:41.130
We're finally at the goblin assault.

00:08:41.130 --> 00:08:43.420
Hiro, did you polish your sword?

00:08:43.420 --> 00:08:44.170
Yes.

00:08:44.170 --> 00:08:45.630
Have you eaten?

00:08:45.630 --> 00:08:47.260
Yes, but not too much.

00:08:47.260 --> 00:08:47.970
Did you pee?

00:08:47.970 --> 00:08:48.670
I did.

00:08:48.670 --> 00:08:49.340
Poop?

00:08:49.340 --> 00:08:50.590
Yes.

00:08:50.590 --> 00:08:52.930
All right! You're fully prepared!

00:08:52.930 --> 00:08:58.930
I don't know about "fully,"
but whatever happens happens.

00:08:58.930 --> 00:09:01.270
I have an anouncement to make.

00:09:01.270 --> 00:09:07.650
Given the heightened danger of the goblins,
two new fighters will join our ranks.

00:09:07.650 --> 00:09:10.070
Replacements for Granada.

00:09:10.070 --> 00:09:13.450
It may just be two,
but I'm glad to have more support.

00:09:15.120 --> 00:09:17.580
This is Inquisitor Mizarisa

00:09:17.580 --> 00:09:20.910
and Fruit Knife Wielder From Hell Alicia.

00:09:20.910 --> 00:09:22.500
Make them feel welcome.

00:09:22.500 --> 00:09:24.710
Are you kidding me?!

00:09:24.710 --> 00:09:29.210
As if the goblins weren't enough!
How is that fair?!

00:09:29.210 --> 00:09:32.050
Hey, Hiro! Good to see ya again!

00:09:32.050 --> 00:09:34.850
Have you wet yourself
wonderfully today, too?

00:09:34.850 --> 00:09:38.140
Wet myself? I'm not a baby!

00:09:38.140 --> 00:09:40.890
I look forward to working with you.

00:09:45.770 --> 00:09:48.860
Women you've met join you
in your time of need.

00:09:48.860 --> 00:09:51.780
A proper video game development: a harem!

00:09:51.780 --> 00:09:53.950
Good for you, Hiro!

00:09:53.950 --> 00:09:55.870
It's not good at all!

00:09:55.870 --> 00:10:01.410
I might get hacked up by fruit knives and
a saw before the goblins even show up!

00:10:01.410 --> 00:10:05.710
We have evacuated those on the
outskirts to the center of the city,

00:10:05.710 --> 00:10:08.920
but many have ignored
the evacuation order.

00:10:08.920 --> 00:10:12.420
There are also reports of crime
occurring out of our sight.

00:10:12.420 --> 00:10:15.970
Thus I'd like you all to go on patrol.

00:10:15.970 --> 00:10:16.600
Yes, sir!

00:10:16.600 --> 00:10:19.970
What? Is today not
the day the goblins attack?

00:10:19.970 --> 00:10:24.060
Hmm. It looks like
there's another event first.

00:10:24.060 --> 00:10:27.230
Well, I'm sure it won't
be a very difficult event.

00:10:27.230 --> 00:10:29.020
I hope so...

00:10:29.020 --> 00:10:30.320
Hiro.

00:10:30.320 --> 00:10:33.570
I'm assigning you to the eastern district.

00:10:33.570 --> 00:10:34.860
Eastern district?

00:10:34.860 --> 00:10:36.660
It's where Ginji was.

00:10:36.660 --> 00:10:37.700
What?

00:10:37.700 --> 00:10:39.790
Oh? Is there a problem?

00:10:39.790 --> 00:10:42.660
Oh, no problem! It's fine!

00:10:42.660 --> 00:10:47.880
Good. Take Mizarisa
and Alicia on patrol with you.

00:10:47.880 --> 00:10:50.130
There's a huge problem with that!

00:10:50.130 --> 00:10:53.050
I'm so happy to be with Hiro!

00:10:54.510 --> 00:10:56.930
So you two <i>are </i>close.

00:10:56.930 --> 00:11:00.140
I thought so when I saw you
wave to each other earlier.

00:11:00.140 --> 00:11:02.140
She waved. I didn't!

00:11:02.140 --> 00:11:04.060
B-Besides!

00:11:04.060 --> 00:11:08.190
As you're aware,
Alicia has a grudge against me.

00:11:08.190 --> 00:11:10.440
It's an opportunity to clear things up!

00:11:10.440 --> 00:11:15.570
It won't do to have
discord among our ranks.

00:11:15.570 --> 00:11:17.200
But!

00:11:17.200 --> 00:11:18.820
I leave it to you, Hiro.

00:11:18.820 --> 00:11:21.540
T-T-T-Tesla!

00:11:25.080 --> 00:11:27.290
Hiro, are you sure?

00:11:27.290 --> 00:11:28.880
About what?

00:11:28.880 --> 00:11:32.840
I wasn't making a fuss back there, but...

00:11:32.840 --> 00:11:37.300
We've got a pretty big score to settle.

00:11:37.300 --> 00:11:40.470
She was about to kill you.

00:11:40.470 --> 00:11:43.220
And above all, she's creepy.

00:11:43.220 --> 00:11:46.230
You know you're pretty creepy yourself...

00:11:46.230 --> 00:11:49.440
We should keep away from her.

00:11:49.440 --> 00:11:51.440
I wish you'd keep away from me.

00:11:51.440 --> 00:11:53.730
So mean!

00:11:53.730 --> 00:11:58.110
Now, now. Alicia maybe,
but Mizarisa has no desire to kill you.

00:11:58.110 --> 00:12:02.620
Yeah. Instead she has
a raring desire to torture me.

00:12:02.620 --> 00:12:07.210
Anyway, why are there problems in town
during an impending goblin attack?

00:12:07.210 --> 00:12:12.460
You dummy. Order breaks down
most when things look bleak!

00:12:12.460 --> 00:12:16.340
I don't need that level
of realism in a game...

00:12:16.340 --> 00:12:18.880
Or is it the other way around?

00:12:18.880 --> 00:12:24.640
Maybe chaos in people's hearts
brings about chaos in the world.

00:12:24.640 --> 00:12:28.940
I wasn't seeking a
philosophical discussion.

00:12:28.940 --> 00:12:30.520
Thief!

00:12:30.520 --> 00:12:32.820
Help!

00:12:33.190 --> 00:12:35.070
Move it!

00:12:42.450 --> 00:12:46.830
F-For real? Nice one, Alici--

00:12:52.790 --> 00:12:54.500
Gross!

00:12:54.500 --> 00:12:58.510
Isn't this great, Hiro?
Let's go return her purse!

00:12:58.510 --> 00:13:01.550
B-B-But there's a hand on it!

00:13:01.550 --> 00:13:04.470
It could be considered,
like, a premium upgrade.

00:13:04.470 --> 00:13:06.390
In what universe?!

00:13:06.390 --> 00:13:08.350
You saved a townsperson!

00:13:08.350 --> 00:13:10.520
This is an RPG standard!

00:13:10.520 --> 00:13:12.600
I bet you get a reward!

00:13:12.600 --> 00:13:15.440
Th-That's a good point.

00:13:16.570 --> 00:13:18.860
E-Excuse me.

00:13:18.860 --> 00:13:21.950
Your purse, ma'am.

00:13:25.160 --> 00:13:26.910
Of course it turned out this way!

00:13:26.910 --> 00:13:29.750
Darn. There was no reward.

00:13:32.540 --> 00:13:36.840
You there. Why the hell did you do this?

00:13:36.840 --> 00:13:40.670
Th-The goblins are
gonna kill us all anyway!

00:13:40.670 --> 00:13:46.760
So you decided to satisfy your
appetites while you could. Is that it?

00:13:46.760 --> 00:13:50.270
You got desparate so easily.

00:13:50.270 --> 00:13:55.860
You know some people die young,
despite how badly they want to live.

00:13:55.860 --> 00:13:58.230
Right, Hiro?

00:13:58.230 --> 00:14:01.030
She's definitely referring to Martin!

00:14:01.030 --> 00:14:04.660
Don't kill me! I only did it
because I was encouraged to!

00:14:04.660 --> 00:14:05.910
Excuse me?

00:14:05.910 --> 00:14:11.250
He's been telling people that with the
Guard distracted, it's the perfect time!

00:14:11.250 --> 00:14:12.080
What?

00:14:12.080 --> 00:14:12.960
Thief!

00:14:12.960 --> 00:14:14.540
Help!

00:14:14.540 --> 00:14:14.670
Stop!

00:14:14.670 --> 00:14:15.830
Help!

00:14:15.830 --> 00:14:18.250
Leona, so then...

00:14:18.250 --> 00:14:21.220
Someone is instigating these crimes.

00:14:21.220 --> 00:14:24.260
Perhaps its the boss of this event.

00:14:24.260 --> 00:14:25.140
Boss?!

00:14:25.140 --> 00:14:29.310
I bet I can get a weapon
that will help against the goblins.

00:14:30.810 --> 00:14:33.850
Hey! Tell us where to find this guy!

00:14:33.850 --> 00:14:37.110
H-He's at the casino right over there.

00:14:48.990 --> 00:14:51.830
There're a lot of them.

00:14:51.830 --> 00:14:53.960
They're scary.

00:14:53.960 --> 00:14:56.380
Let's see...

00:14:56.380 --> 00:14:58.840
Hiro, that must be the boss!

00:14:58.840 --> 00:15:00.630
H-He looks tough.

00:15:00.630 --> 00:15:02.170
I'll take him.

00:15:02.170 --> 00:15:05.760
Since the only thing you're
good for is peeing yourself.

00:15:05.760 --> 00:15:07.140
Shut up!

00:15:07.140 --> 00:15:10.180
Hiro, you rescue the captives.

00:15:10.180 --> 00:15:11.720
O-Okay.

00:15:11.720 --> 00:15:14.480
Come on. You better help, too.

00:15:20.940 --> 00:15:26.610
I'm Inquisitor--no, right now
I'm Mizarisa of the City Guard!

00:15:26.610 --> 00:15:28.950
Surrender and be taken into custody.

00:15:28.950 --> 00:15:31.660
The City Guard?

00:15:31.660 --> 00:15:32.790
Interesting.

00:15:32.790 --> 00:15:34.080
Let's do this!

00:15:34.080 --> 00:15:35.460
You wanna go?

00:15:35.460 --> 00:15:37.460
Great!

00:15:41.590 --> 00:15:43.550
Now's my chance!

00:15:44.760 --> 00:15:47.050
You're safe now.

00:15:47.050 --> 00:15:49.050
What?

00:15:49.050 --> 00:15:50.680
Ginji?!

00:15:50.680 --> 00:15:53.810
What, you again?

00:15:53.810 --> 00:15:56.520
They captured you, too?

00:15:56.520 --> 00:16:00.480
Yeah! They took me and
were going to sell me off!

00:16:00.480 --> 00:16:02.020
For real?

00:16:02.020 --> 00:16:05.490
Who the hell would buy
an old dude like him?

00:16:14.040 --> 00:16:16.580
That was disappointing.

00:16:16.580 --> 00:16:22.750
Mr. Ginji, this isn't what you promised!

00:16:22.750 --> 00:16:24.420
Hiro!

00:16:24.420 --> 00:16:26.720
Don't you two move!

00:16:26.720 --> 00:16:28.970
If you do, I'll snap his neck!

00:16:28.970 --> 00:16:31.760
Hiro!

00:16:31.760 --> 00:16:35.680
Ginji, <i>you </i>were the instigator?

00:16:35.680 --> 00:16:38.730
You make it sound so bad.

00:16:38.730 --> 00:16:43.360
This area's been going downhill
since the goblins first attacked.

00:16:43.360 --> 00:16:46.190
I just gave it a little push!

00:16:46.190 --> 00:16:49.110
Wh-Why would you do that?

00:16:49.110 --> 00:16:52.950
Why, to draw the Guard's attention away!

00:16:52.950 --> 00:16:56.120
I made myself a nice profit.

00:16:56.120 --> 00:16:58.830
You blended in with the NPCs to steal?

00:16:58.830 --> 00:17:01.580
Well, that all ends today.

00:17:01.580 --> 00:17:04.670
Hey! Leave your valuables and get out!

00:17:04.670 --> 00:17:06.960
Otherwise I'll kill him!

00:17:06.960 --> 00:17:12.010
Oh, Ginji makes a refreshing villain!

00:17:12.010 --> 00:17:14.220
You asshole.

00:17:14.220 --> 00:17:18.060
After everything, I thought
we'd started a friendship of sorts.

00:17:18.060 --> 00:17:19.520
Idiot.

00:17:19.520 --> 00:17:21.400
Becoming friends after a fight?

00:17:21.400 --> 00:17:24.150
That's high-school drama nonsense.

00:17:24.150 --> 00:17:29.110
We're just two people who
met in a game. Nothing more.

00:17:29.110 --> 00:17:31.740
Oh, I see. I see!

00:17:31.740 --> 00:17:35.120
We'll never come to an understanding then.

00:17:35.120 --> 00:17:37.080
I hear you loud and clear,

00:17:37.080 --> 00:17:39.910
you old fart!

00:17:41.420 --> 00:17:44.380
D-Damned brat!

00:17:44.380 --> 00:17:48.170
Amazing, Hiro! Against Ginji,
that was astonishingly good!

00:17:48.170 --> 00:17:49.720
Leave the rest to me.

00:17:49.720 --> 00:17:51.180
Wait, Mizarisa!

00:17:51.180 --> 00:17:52.130
Hiro?

00:17:52.130 --> 00:17:54.430
Stay out of this one.

00:17:54.430 --> 00:17:57.010
This guy's mine.

00:17:57.010 --> 00:18:00.770
What? You cocky brat.

00:18:00.770 --> 00:18:02.390
So it starts again!

00:18:02.390 --> 00:18:04.940
A fight between fated rivals!

00:18:04.940 --> 00:18:08.860
Things are going to go
differently today, kid.

00:18:08.860 --> 00:18:12.490
I've got a stronger weapon with me.

00:18:12.490 --> 00:18:15.490
D-Don't tell me he has a magic item...

00:18:15.490 --> 00:18:18.120
Double brass knuckles!

00:18:19.370 --> 00:18:22.000
You're dead, kid!

00:18:22.000 --> 00:18:23.830
That's the same as last time!

00:18:23.830 --> 00:18:25.210
Are you stupid?

00:18:25.210 --> 00:18:29.050
You dumbass! It's twice the attack power!

00:18:30.760 --> 00:18:33.090
Now die!

00:18:33.090 --> 00:18:35.590
Like I'll lose!

00:18:35.590 --> 00:18:39.810
Small fry fight! Go, Ginji! Go, Hiro!

00:18:47.440 --> 00:18:49.980
Can we put an end to this farce now?

00:18:49.980 --> 00:18:51.400
Farce?!

00:18:51.400 --> 00:18:54.240
An NPC called it a farce...

00:18:54.240 --> 00:18:55.910
I-I'm sorry!

00:18:55.910 --> 00:18:58.620
Please forgive me.

00:18:58.620 --> 00:19:02.040
H-How pathetic can this get?

00:19:03.160 --> 00:19:05.960
Okay, line up!

00:19:05.960 --> 00:19:07.840
Looks like the event ended.

00:19:07.840 --> 00:19:09.340
Yeah.

00:19:09.340 --> 00:19:13.010
Your childhood friend is strong.

00:19:13.010 --> 00:19:16.930
With my gout I couldn't do a thing.

00:19:16.930 --> 00:19:22.310
But, Ginji, didn't you kill both your
best friend and childhood friend?

00:19:22.310 --> 00:19:24.180
It was years ago.

00:19:24.180 --> 00:19:30.480
And I killed my childhood friend before
she awakened as Hell's Fruit Slicer.

00:19:33.490 --> 00:19:36.030
That sound creeps me out every time.

00:19:36.030 --> 00:19:41.370
I guess that's what happens to
a person who's locked in a cell forever.

00:19:41.370 --> 00:19:42.950
You seem calm.

00:19:42.950 --> 00:19:44.410
Well, yeah.

00:19:44.410 --> 00:19:46.500
What's with the act?

00:19:46.500 --> 00:19:51.500
I'll get meals for free, and the
goblins can't reach me in the cell.

00:19:51.500 --> 00:19:55.470
Depending on the perspective,
prison life ain't so bad.

00:19:55.470 --> 00:19:57.550
I see! Positive thinking!

00:19:57.550 --> 00:20:00.100
I don't think that's what that means!

00:20:00.100 --> 00:20:04.390
Well, I also got out of a few
pinches this way in real life.

00:20:04.390 --> 00:20:09.060
What? You intentionally commit
small crimes to go to jail?

00:20:09.060 --> 00:20:11.360
This guy is seriously scum.

00:20:11.360 --> 00:20:13.530
A bit of life wisdom!

00:20:13.530 --> 00:20:15.740
That's not what that means!

00:20:15.740 --> 00:20:18.570
Let's go! No dawdling!

00:20:20.320 --> 00:20:24.750
You should really re-examine your life.

00:20:24.750 --> 00:20:30.250
I ain't a kid anymore.
I ain't gonna change at my age.

00:20:36.420 --> 00:20:40.930
Hiro, good work capturing
that gang of thieves.

00:20:40.930 --> 00:20:42.970
I didn't do much.

00:20:42.970 --> 00:20:45.970
It was all Mizarisa and Alicia--

00:20:49.600 --> 00:20:51.560
It's the goblins!

00:20:51.560 --> 00:20:54.150
They're finally here.

00:20:54.150 --> 00:20:55.940
Hiro, this is it!

00:20:55.940 --> 00:20:57.900
R-Right!

00:20:58.450 --> 00:21:00.030
They're at the north gate!

00:20:58.650 --> 00:21:01.280
Huh? Wh-What is this?

00:21:00.030 --> 00:21:01.280
All right. Let's go!

00:21:01.280 --> 00:21:02.450
Yes, sir!

00:21:02.450 --> 00:21:04.910
M-My stomach!

00:21:04.910 --> 00:21:08.540
I told you to use the bathroom earlier!

00:21:08.540 --> 00:21:10.040
I did!

00:21:10.040 --> 00:21:11.420
But...

00:21:11.420 --> 00:21:14.340
I got it. It must be extreme nerves.

00:21:14.340 --> 00:21:18.760
You know, like how on test days you
need to use the bathroom a bunch?

00:21:18.760 --> 00:21:19.430
What?

00:21:19.430 --> 00:21:21.430
Sound familiar?

00:21:23.930 --> 00:21:25.850
Y-Yes, it does!

00:21:25.850 --> 00:21:28.060
But this is in a game!

00:21:28.060 --> 00:21:31.940
As I've told you,
KQ is the pinnacle of realism!

00:21:31.940 --> 00:21:35.730
Things that would happen
in real life happen in game!

00:21:35.730 --> 00:21:38.570
Anyway, just go use the bathroom!

00:21:45.280 --> 00:21:46.740
Shit! Come out already!

00:21:46.740 --> 00:21:49.160
Shit!

00:21:49.160 --> 00:21:51.120
Everyone's fighting the goblins.

00:21:51.120 --> 00:21:54.080
What am I fighting?

00:21:56.750 --> 00:21:58.800
Yes! Much better.

00:21:58.800 --> 00:22:01.220
Now to find Tesla.

00:22:07.850 --> 00:22:10.020
Eek!

00:22:10.020 --> 00:22:14.020
A goblin's peeking at me!

00:23:45.990 --> 00:23:49.280
Episode 11: City of Dead Ends.
